ndler line, 10 dim 20 err 30 resume next\", Err.Number: Err.Clear\n    On Error Resume Next: rbtOk = False: P \"a clear erl\", A14(): If Not rbtOk Then PE \"a clear erl\", Err.Number: Err.Clear\n    On Error Resume Next: rbtOk = False: P \"a erl after on error\", A15(): If Not rbtOk Then PE \"a erl after on error\", Err.Number: Err.Clear\n    On Error Resume Next: rbtOk = False: P \"a 10dim 20err 30 then 40err\", A16(): If Not rbtOk Then PE \"a 10dim 20err 30 then 40err\", Err.Number: Err.Clear\n    On Error Resume Next: rbtOk = False: P \"a 10 label colon\", A17(): If Not rbtOk Then PE \"a 10 label colon\", Err.Number: Err.Clear\nEnd Sub\nFunction A1()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n20  a = 1 / 0\n30  a = 2\n40  a = 3\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A1 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A2()\n    Dim b\n    On Error GoTo h\n5   b = 1\n10  Dim a\n20  a = 1 / 0\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A2 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A3()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n15  Dim b\n20  a = 1 / 0\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A3 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A4()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n20  a = 1 / 0\n    a = 5\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A4 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A5()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a As Long\n20  a = 1 / 0\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A5 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A6()\n    Dim a\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Const k = 1\n20  a = 1 / 0\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A6 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A7()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n20  Err.Raise 5\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A7 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A8()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n20  a = 1 / 0\n30  Dim b\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A8 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A9()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n20  a = 1\n30  a = 1 / 0\n40  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A9 = Erl\nEnd Function\nFunction A10()\n    On Error GoTo h\n10  Dim a\n20  Fails\n30  a = 2\n    Exit Function\nh:\n    A10 = Erl\nEnd Function\nSub Fails()\n    Dim 